margin:0 auto; -> for centering a div
Margin-top/left-> outside div position
Padding-top/left=> content will occupy inside space
float-left/right-> div on left/right-Folat:left;width 10%-> multiple div on same row 
Positioning a div:-
	Position: static -> default. behaves like a plain div
			  Relative -> will occupy position with respect to parent div.
						  Extra styling work with Position:relative-> Margin-left/top/bottom/right.
			  Absolute -> if any nearest position :relative div is there , it will occupy space with respect to this div
						  if no relative div is there, it will take space from top most parent.
						  Extra styling work with Position:Absolute-> left/top/bottom/right.
			  Fixed ->    Position of div is fixed with respect to broswer window.
			  
